# Admin · 接送（依赖先登录，见 ../_login.http）

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pickup/overview?date=2026-03-19
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 接送记录（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pickup/records?date=2026-03-19&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 异常记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pickup/abnormal?date=2026-03-19&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 审核授权接送人（将 :id 换为 review_status=0 的授权 ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/pickup/authorized-persons/4/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminPasswordLogin.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "approve",
  "remark": ""
}
